{
  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding without image data or fusion, establishing a baseline for singleprofile RNA modality performance. The validation accuracy of 0.485 suggests moderate performance, with validation F1 of 0.464 supporting this baseline. The role of image data and multimodal interactions remains uncertain due to lack of comparative evidence."
}

